{
  "bookId": "activity-extra-shilaimuyure",
  "id": "source-23350",
  "sections": [
    {
      "blocks": [
        {
          "sourceId": "23350001",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "旁白",
          "text": "FULI公司本周将联动《关于我转生变成史莱姆这档事》，发行全新魔王手办。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350002",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "每期FULI公司的手办上新情报，主人还真是从不会错过呀。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350003",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "魔王呀，一听就是很帅气的称号了，会是怎样的两个角色呢。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350004",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "优纪想知道吗？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350005",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "想！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350006",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那听好了，这次FULI公司联动的角色一共有两位。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350007",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "嗯嗯！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350008",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "其中一位是魔王，另一位……也是魔王！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350009",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "……嗯。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350010",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "FULI公司非常重视这次联动。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350011",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "哦？！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350012",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "毕竟他们上次这么大型的联动，还是在上次。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350013",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "？？？？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350014",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人你这些话说的有什么意义吗？！！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350015",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "但凡有一点意义也不至于一点意义都没有。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350016",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人……你没事吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350017",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "如果想要知道更多的信息，还请期待明天的新手办情报吧。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350018",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "等等，为什么这就结束了啊！主人你到底说了什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350019",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "如果你仔细听了的话，你就会发现……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350020",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "发现什么？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350021",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "发现我什么都没说。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350022",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "？？？？？",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350023",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "主人好像坏掉了……",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350024",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "玩家",
          "text": "那么还请期待明天的情报分享。",
          "type": "dialogue"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "23350025",
          "sourceType": 0,
          "speaker": "优纪",
          "text": "才不要期待啦！",
          "type": "dialogue"
        }
      ],
